<TD WIDTH="9%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(a)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">the Plan of Merger, by and among Black Spade Acquisition Co (&#147;Black Spade&#148;), Nuevo Tech Limited
(&#147;Merger Sub&#148;) and VinFast Auto Pte. Ltd. (&#147;VinFast&#148;), substantially in the form attached to the accompanying proxy statement/prospectus as Annex B (the &#147;Plan of Merger&#148;), be authorized and approved in all respects;
</P></TD></TR></TABLE>
