<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">VinFast&#146;s ability to maintain its relationship with existing critical suppliers and to create relationships
