failure to accurately and timely report VinFast&#146;s financial condition, results of operations or cash flows could adversely affect investor confidence; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
