<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">If third parties bring claims against Black Spade, the proceeds held in the Trust Account could be reduced and
the per-share redemption amount received by BSAQ Shareholders may be less than $10.00 per share </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
