capacity within Vietnam may be subject to delays or cost overruns, may not produce expected benefits or may cause VinFast to not meet its projections for future production capacity; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
