reaching its decision to approve the Proposed Transactions, Black Spade&#146;s Board of Directors reviewed the results of due diligence conducted by Black Spade&#146;s management and by Black Spade&#146;s legal and financial advisors, which
included, among other things: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
