<Center><DIV STYLE="width:8.5in" align="left">
 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Note: For comparable models, the MSRPs are the prices of base model in the U.S as of June 10, 2023, the
specifications are from official websites of the companies or other publicly available sources. For the VF 6, the MSRP and specification refers to targets for the Eco trim in the U.S. Subsidies primarily include potential incentives from the U.S.
