However, Frost &amp; Sullivan assumes none of the above models are eligible for the Clean Vehicles Credit of $7,500 under the IRA due to the uncertainty surrounding who will ultimately be able to claim this tax credit, the fact that not all
customers are eligible, and the uncertainty surrounding regulations governing the requirements for critical minerals and battery components. Customers&#146; eligibility for this tax credit is determined based on their income brackets. If the
