<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">know-how,</FONT> inventions and patents (excluding software) developed
(&#147;Foreground IP&#148;) pursuant to service contracts dated December&nbsp;9, 2020 (as amended), and July&nbsp;16, 2021, relating to the development of the EDS system for use in our EV platform in the U.S. Market in
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">A-,</FONT> <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">B-</FONT> and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">C-segment</FONT> EVs, which we have received an exclusive intellectual property right for the Foreground IP. We have also
received a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-exclusive,</FONT> royalty-free right to use any software generated through the Foreground IP. In addition, we also received a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-exclusive,</FONT> royalty free right
to use the intellectual property incorporated in the technology; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
