<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">inventions and intellectual property developed pursuant to development agreements dated January&nbsp;26, 2021
(as amended) and April&nbsp;22, 2021 (as amended) relating to a vehicle engineering design and development and an aftersales engineering design, to which we received exclusive rights. In addition, we received a
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-exclusive</FONT> right to use, and title over, the intellectual property incorporated in the technology; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
