<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">works, copyright and intellectual property developed pursuant to a master service agreement dated
October&nbsp;12, 2021, relating to the engineering development support of the electrical&nbsp;&amp; electronic delivery and the full vehicle turnkey engineering for our EVs, which we acquired sole ownership. In addition, we received a license to use
the intellectual property incorporated in such technology; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
