other executive officers, including reviewing and approving corporate goals and objectives relevant to the compensation of the Chief Executive Officer and other executive officers, including evaluating their performance in light of such goals and
objectives; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
