BSAQ Class B Ordinary Shares currently held by the Sponsor and the other Initial Shareholders in connection with the Business Combination. Under the maximum redemptions scenario, consists of
</P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">355 </P>

