<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(6)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Consists of 769,989,498 ordinary shares held of record by VIG, a joint stock company organized in Vietnam and a
majority-owned affiliate of Mr.&nbsp;Pham Nhat Vuong. The address of VIG is No.&nbsp;7, Bang Lang 1 Street, Viet Hung Ward, Long Bien District, Hanoi, Vietnam. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
