 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Upon initial issuance, the Company used a Monte Carlo simulation model to value the Sponsor note payable.
The Sponsor note payable was within Level&nbsp;3 of the fair value hierarchy at the initial measurement dates due to the use of unobservable inputs. The key inputs into the discount model as of March&nbsp;31, 2023 and December&nbsp;31, 2022 for the
