<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Observable inputs other than Level&nbsp;1 inputs. Examples of Level&nbsp;2 inputs include quoted prices in
active markets for similar assets or liabilities and quoted prices for identical assets or liabilities in markets that are not active. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
