<TD WIDTH="3%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>6.</B></TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top" STYLE="font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><B>IMPAIRMENT OF LONG-LIVED ASSETS </B></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of March&nbsp;31, 2023, the Group identified
specific impairment indicators associated with individual assets of <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">leased-out</FONT> batteries due to competitive lease subscription fee for pioneer customers. The Group impaired these identified assets based on
contractual lease payments agreed with customers. Impairment charges of VND480,643&nbsp;million (USD20.4 million) relating to <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">leased-out</FONT> batteries under the Automotive and
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">E-scooter</FONT> segments were recognized for the three months ended March&nbsp;31, 2023. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-68 </P>

