<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Balance as of March&nbsp;31, 2023 represents deposits and down payment received in advance from customers for sales of automobiles, <FONT
