<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-refundable</FONT> down-payment of contract liabilities. Revenue recognized in the three months ended March&nbsp;31, 2023 from the contract liabilities at beginning of the year amounted to approximately
VND910.2&nbsp;billion (USD38.6 million). </P> <P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
