<TD WIDTH="4%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">In January 2022, VinFast Vietnam decided to extend the warranty policy to earlier of 10 years or the first
200,000 km for all internal-combustion-engine (ICE) cars sold since 2019 and to be sold thereafter. The estimated warranty cost was substantially supported by Chairman of the Company, in the form of upfront payment of VND350&nbsp;billion (USD14.8
million), which was received in cash by VinFast Vietnam in June 2022. This amount was recognized as Additional <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">paid-in</FONT> capital in the consolidated statements of shareholders&#146; equity.
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">&#149;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">With regard to the ICE <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">phasing-out</FONT> (Note 1), ICE assets were transferred
to Vietnam Investment Group Joint Stock Company (&#147;VIG&#148;) completely in 2022 with a gain of VND11,961.7&nbsp;billion (USD506.9 million) being recognized in the consolidated statements of shareholders&#146; equity. Please refer to Note 21,
Section &#147;<I>Transactions with VIG JSC related to ICE assets disposal</I>&#148; for details. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-97 </P>

</DIV></Center>


