STYLE="white-space:nowrap">(paid-in-arrears)</FONT></FONT> of Joint Stock Commercial Bank for Foreign Trade of Vietnam, Bank for Investment and Development of Vietnam, Vietnam Joint Stock Commercial Bank for Industry and Trade and Vietnam
