<TD WIDTH="4%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="5%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(iii)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">In December 2022, the General Shareholders of VinFast Vietnam approved the issuance of 2,578,216,022 Dividend
preference shares (&#147;DPS3&#148;) to Vingroup JSC at par value of VND10,000 per&nbsp;share. Vingroup used the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">P-Notes</FONT> as consideration to subscribe for DPS3 (Note 1(a)). These preference shares are
</P></TD></TR></TABLE>
