<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Equity Security</B>&#148; means (i)&nbsp;any share capital, partnership interest, membership interest or unit, capital stock, equity
interest, voting security or other ownership interest, (ii)&nbsp;any other interest or participation (including phantom units or interests) that confers on a Person the right to receive a unit of the profits and losses of, or distribution of assets
