<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Governmental Authority</B>&#148; means any supra-national, federal, regional, state, provincial, municipal, local or foreign
