<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Government Official</B>&#148; means any public or elected official or officer, employee (regardless of rank), or Person acting on
