STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-U.S.</FONT> political party, <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-U.S.</FONT> party official or any candidate for political office. Officers, employees (regardless of rank), or Persons acting on behalf of an entity
that is financed in large measure through public appropriations, is widely perceived to be performing government functions, or has its key officers and directors appointed by a government should also be considered &#147;Government Officials.&#148;
