of expression, (iv)&nbsp;Internet domain names and social media identifiers and accounts, (v)&nbsp;trade secrets, proprietary <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">know-how</FONT> (including manufacturing and production processes and research and
development information), confidential and proprietary information, including processes, data, inventions, technical data, algorithms, formulae, procedures, protocols, techniques, results of experimentation and testing, and business information
(including financial and marketing plans, customer and </P>
