<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Merger Surviving Company</B>&#148; has the meaning given to such term in Section&nbsp;3.01(b). </P>
