Subsidiaries by the Company or any of its Subsidiaries, as applicable, (a)&nbsp;in the Ordinary Course of Business; or (b)&nbsp;in connection with the termination of employment of any employee of the Company or its Subsidiaries, (ii)&nbsp;any
payment by the Company or any of its Subsidiaries to (or on behalf of, or for the benefit of) any Related Party in respect of salary, bonus or other ordinary course compensation, director or manager fees, reimbursement or advancement of expenses,
indemnification or other benefits due to such individual in their </P>
