table below shall bear the meanings set opposite to them respectively in the second column thereof, if not inconsistent with the subject or context:</P></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">Interpretation</TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font-size:1pt">
